Tinker Tailor Soldier Spy is a drama, thriller,
mystery film directed by Tomas Alfredson.

3
00:20:03,157 --> 00:20:09,157
In the bleak days of the Cold War, espionage veteran George Smiley is forced from
semi-retirement to uncover a Soviet mole within his former colleagues at the heart of MI6.

